<?php /** @var \Sysfera\Plugin $sf @var \SysferaStoragerent\Ctx $ctx @var string $lang @var array $rows @var array $tenants @var array $contracts @var array $open @var array $credit @var int $tenantId @var bool $canWrite @var array $methods @var string $today */
require __DIR__ . '/_nav.php'; $tn = $tenants; ?>
<form class="sr-filter" method="get" action="<?= e($sf->url('/payments')) ?>"><select name="tenant"><option value="0"><?= e($sf->t('all_tenants')) ?></option><?php foreach ($tn as $id => $n): ?><option value="<?= (int)$id ?>"<?= (int)$id === $tenantId ? ' selected' : '' ?>><?= e($n) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><button class="btn"><?= e($sf->t('search')) ?></button></form>
<?php if ($credit): ?><div class="card"><b><?= e($sf->t('pay_credit')) ?>:</b> <?php foreach ($credit as $tid => $c): ?><span class="badge info"><?= e($tn[$tid] ?? '') ?>: <?= e(sr_m($c, $lang)) ?></span> <?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if (!$rows): ?><div class="card empty"><?= e($sf->t('none')) ?></div><?php else: ?>
<div class="card sr-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th><?= e($sf->t('col_date')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('col_tenant')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('col_method')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('f_reference')) ?></th><th class="r"><?= e($sf->t('f_amount')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('pay_allocated')) ?></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($rows as $p): $isPay = $p['kind'] === 'payment'; ?><tr><td><?= e(sr_d($p['pay_date'])) ?></td><td><a href="<?= e($sf->url('/tenant/' . $p['tenant_id'])) ?>"><?= e($p['tenant_name']) ?></a></td>
  <td><?= $isPay ? e($sf->t('pm_' . $p['method'])) : '<span class="badge warn">' . e($sf->t('pay_refund')) . '</span>' ?></td><td><?= e($p['reference'] !== '' ? $p['reference'] : $p['note']) ?></td><td class="r"><?= e(sr_m($p['amount'], $lang)) ?></td>
  <td><?php if ($isPay): foreach ($p['allocations'] as $a): ?><a href="<?= e($sf->url('/invoice/' . $a['invoice_id'])) ?>">#<?= (int)$a['invoice_id'] ?></a>: <?= e(sr_m($a['amount'], $lang)) ?>; <?php endforeach; if ($p['unallocated'] > 0): ?><span class="badge info"><?= e($sf->t('pay_unallocated')) ?>: <?= e(sr_m($p['unallocated'], $lang)) ?></span><?php endif; endif; ?>
  <?php if ($isPay && $canWrite && !empty($open[$p['tenant_id']])): ?><details><summary><?= e($sf->t('pay_reassign')) ?></summary>
    <form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/payments/' . $p['id'] . '/reassign')) ?>" class="sr-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><p class="muted sm"><?= e($sf->t('pay_reassign_help')) ?></p>
      <?php $cur = []; foreach ($p['allocations'] as $a) $cur[(int)$a['invoice_id']] = (int)$a['amount']; foreach ($open[$p['tenant_id']] as $i): ?><label class="fld"><span><?= e($i['number']) ?> (<?= e(sr_m($i['outstanding'] + ($cur[(int)$i['id']] ?? 0), $lang)) ?>)</span><input name="alloc[<?= (int)$i['id'] ?>]" value="<?= e(isset($cur[(int)$i['id']]) ? \SysferaStoragerent\Billing::dec($cur[(int)$i['id']]) : '') ?>" inputmode="decimal"></label><?php endforeach; ?>
      <button class="btn"><?= e($sf->t('save')) ?></button></form></details><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($canWrite): ?><div class="grid2">
<form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/payments/add')) ?>" class="card sr-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><h3><?= e($sf->t('pay_new')) ?></h3><p class="muted sm"><?= e($sf->t('pay_new_help')) ?></p>
  <?= sr_sel('tenant_id', $sf->t('col_tenant'), $tn, $tenantId) ?><?= sr_sel('contract_id', $sf->t('col_contract'), [0 => '—'] + array_column(array_map(fn($k) => ['id' => $k['id'], 'n' => $k['number']], $contracts), 'n', 'id'), 0) ?>
  <div class="sr-2"><?= sr_in('date', $sf->t('col_date'), $today, 'date', 'required') ?><?= sr_in('amount', $sf->t('f_amount'), '', 'text', 'required inputmode="decimal"') ?></div>
  <div class="sr-2"><?= sr_sel('method', $sf->t('col_method'), array_combine($methods, array_map(fn($m) => $sf->t('pm_' . $m), $methods)), 'bank') ?><?= sr_in('reference', $sf->t('f_reference'), '', 'text', 'maxlength="120"') ?></div><button class="btn primary"><?= e($sf->t('pay_register')) ?></button></form>
<form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/payments/refund')) ?>" class="card sr-form" onsubmit="return confirm('<?= e($sf->t('confirm_refund')) ?>')"><?= csrf_field() ?><h3><?= e($sf->t('pay_refund')) ?></h3><p class="muted sm"><?= e($sf->t('pay_refund_help')) ?></p>
  <?= sr_sel('tenant_id', $sf->t('col_tenant'), $tn, $tenantId) ?><div class="sr-2"><?= sr_in('date', $sf->t('col_date'), $today, 'date', 'required') ?><?= sr_in('amount', $sf->t('f_amount'), '', 'text', 'required inputmode="decimal"') ?></div><?= sr_in('reason', $sf->t('f_reason'), '', 'text', 'required maxlength="255"') ?><button class="btn"><?= e($sf->t('pay_refund')) ?></button></form></div><?php endif; ?>
